nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"96.6\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,52.1 9.1,55.3 14.2,52.4 19.3,49.9 24.5,51.1 29.6,57.6 34.7,53.0 39.8,51.3 44.9,41.7 50.0,36.8 55.1,32.4 60.3,31.8 65.4,28.5 70.5,39.3 75.6,35.4 80.7,29.0 85.8,22.2 91.0,21.8 96.1,40.0 101.2,36.4 106.3,40.1 111.4,37.9 116.5,38.4 121.6,41.2 126.8,30.2 131.9,31.5 137.0,30.7 142.1,31.8 147.2,15.4 152.3,13.9 157.4,26.7 162.6,28.7 167.7,36.0 172.8,37.3 177.9,36.3 183.0,12.8 188.1,27.0 193.2,28.0 198.4,33.0 203.5,30.8 208.6,33.2 213.7,33.3 218.8,56.2 223.9,42.2 229.0,41.8 234.2,39.1 239.3,47.8 244.4,50.6 249.5,55.7 254.6,56.2 259.7,60.1 264.9,56.4 270.0,54.8 275.1,50.3 280.2,45.5 285.3,55.9 290.4,62.5 295.5,60.3 300.7,68.5 305.8,82.9 310.9,84.1 316.0,92.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 64.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 64.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 64.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 64.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"92.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/20